@model POS.Models.clsFinancialReports
@using (Html.BeginForm("index", "home", FormMethod.Post, new { id = "averageForm", @class = "smart-form", @novalidate = "novalidate", enctype = "multipart/form-data" }))
{
    @Html.HiddenFor(x => x.ByDate, new { @id = "HiddenFomrDate" });
    <div class="row">
        <section class="col col-md-6 col-lg-6">
            <label>From</label>
            <label class="input">
                <i class="icon-prepend fa fa-calendar"></i>
                @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.FromDate, new { @type = "date", @disabled = "disabled", @Value = Model.FromDate.HasValue ? Model.FromDate.GetValueOrDefault().ToString("yyyy/MM/dd") : "" })
            </label>
        </section>
        <section class="col col-md-6 col-lg-6">
            <label>To</label>
            <label class="input">
                <i class="icon-prepend fa fa-calendar"></i>
                <input type="date" name="ToDate" id="ToDate" min="" max="" required />
            </label>
        </section>
    </div>
    <div class="row" hidden>
        <section class="col col-md-12 col-lg-12">
            <label class="checkbox pull-right" style="">
                <input id="Permanent" type="checkbox" name="Permanent"><i></i>
                Permanent
            </label>
        </section>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <section class="col col-md-12  col-lg-12">
            <table class="pull-right footer-nav" style="">
                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <a id="btnSave" class="btn" style="background-color: #015778; width: 95px; height: 30px; margin-left: 10px;color: white;line-height:27px">
                            Save
                        </a>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </section>
    </div>
}
<script src="//code.jquery.com/jquery-1.10.2.js"></script>
<script src="//code.jquery.com/ui/1.11.4/jquery-ui.js"></script>
<script type="text/javascript">
    $(document).ready(function () {
        GetTodayDate();
    })
    $('#btnSave').on('click', function (e) {
        e.preventDefault();
        var fromDate = $('#FromDate').val();
        var toDate = $('#ToDate').val();
        var dueDaysAlert = $('#DueDaysAlert').val();
        var permanent = $('#Permanent').is(':checked');
        var permanentInt = 0;
        if (permanent == true) {
            permanentInt = 1;
        }
        if (toDate == null || toDate == '') {
            $('#ToDate').css('border-color', '#A90329');
            $('#ToDate').css('background-color', '#FFF0F0');
            return false;
        }
        if (fromDate >= toDate) {
            alert("To Date cannot be less than or equal to From Date.");
            return false;
        }
        $('#btnSave').html("<i class='fa fa-spin fa-refresh'></i> Processing...");
        var myForm =
            {
                FromDate: fromDate,
                ToDate: toDate,
                Permanent: permanentInt,
            }
        $.ajax({
            type: 'POST',
            url: '/reports/CalculateAveragePost/',
            dataType: 'json',
            data: { 'reminder': myForm },
            success: function (response) {
                location.reload();
            }
        })
    })
    $('#ToDate').keydown(function () {
        $('#ToDate').css('border-color', '#bdbdbd');
        $('#ToDate').css('background-color', '#fff');
    }).mousedown(function () {
        $('#ToDate').css('border-color', '#bdbdbd');
        $('#ToDate').css('background-color', '#fff');
    })
    function GetTodayDate() {
        var today = new Date();
        var dd = today.getDate();
        var mm = today.getMonth() + 1; //January is 0!

        var yyyy = today.getFullYear();
        if (dd < 10) {
            dd = '0' + dd;
        }
        if (mm < 10) {
            mm = '0' + mm;
        }
        var today = yyyy + '-' + mm + '-' + dd;
        $('#ToDate').val(today);

        var today2 = new Date($("#HiddenFomrDate").val());
        var dd = today2.getDate();
        var mm = today2.getMonth() + 1; //January is 0!

        var yyyy = today2.getFullYear();
        if (dd < 10) {
            dd = '0' + dd;
        }
        if (mm < 10) {
            mm = '0' + mm;
        }
        var today2 = yyyy + '-' + mm + '-' + dd;
        $('#FromDate').val(today2);
    }
</script>